    %% ======================================================================================
    SYNC_DISCOVERY -->|"mDNS scan"| FAM_IPHONE
    SYNC_DISCOVERY -->|"mDNS scan"| FAM_LAPTOP
    SYNC_DISCOVERY -->|"mDNS scan"| FAM_TABLET
    SYNC_DISCOVERY -->|"mDNS scan"| FAM_HUB
