    %% ======================================================================================
    AFFECTIVE_NOW -->|"current emotion"| AFFECTIVE_ROUTING
    AFFECTIVE_ROUTING -->|"emotion-aware selection"| CAPABILITY_RESOLVER
    CONTROL -->|"cognitive load"| COGNITIVE_LOAD_ROUTING
